                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Out of all the games in the worms series I would say this is the best. The actual gameplay is very fun, it is a battle game between two teams of worms on around 20 - 30 different maps by throwing grenades, missiles and other great weapons to defeat the other team. The basic setup is two teams of 4 worms on a single map each worm has 100hp at the start, over the game each worm will attack another from across the map until only one team is left. The game is very fun enjoyable and customisable.\n\nIf you are looking to get into the Worms series, I would recommend you play this game first.",
